# Worker

- Endpoints live under `/api/*`. Static assets via `env.ASSETS`.
- JSON errors: `{ ok:false, error, detail? }`.
- Never log raw emails; hash if needed.
- Secrets via `wrangler secret`, never in git.
- OTP: HMAC-signed token, 6 digits, lock after 5 bad attempts, rate-limit when KV is bound.
- `/api/fx` uses Cache API (24h) and fallback `data/fx-fallback.json` values.
- Observability stays enabled (`observability.traces.enabled`).
- CORS: `https://bridge-tj.lol`, `https://www.bridge-tj.lol`, `http://localhost:*`.
